key-cite bundles data from the Citation Style Language project. These files are not
covered by Key's MIT licence; they keep their own licence and are shipped unmodified.

styles/*.csl
  From https://github.com/citation-style-language/styles
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported licence
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). Each file names its authors and
  contributors in its <info> block.

locales/locales-*.xml
  From https://github.com/citation-style-language/locales
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported licence
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). Each file names its translators in
  its <info> block.

Citations are rendered with hayagriva (https://github.com/typst/hayagriva) and
citationberg (https://github.com/typst/citationberg), both MIT OR Apache-2.0. A copy of
hayagriva 0.10.1 with one fix lives in vendor/hayagriva (its LICENSE-MIT,
LICENSE-APACHE and NOTICE files are kept there).
